@page "/components/spinner"

<PageTitle>Spinner — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Spinner</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The Lucide <code>loader-circle</code> with <code>role="status"</code>, which is what makes it
    announce rather than merely turn. It is for the places nothing was clicked — a region
    refreshing itself, a poll, a deferred fragment.
</p>

