<h2 class="doc-h2">Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Reach for this only when the work is not a request. A button that starts an Unpoly request
    already grows its own spinner from <code>.up-active</code>, with no parameter and nothing to
    clear afterwards.
</p>
